// webui.rc.in - CMake-configured resource script (see CMakeLists.txt,
// NZVIDEOMNI_EMBED_WEBUI). Embeds the single-file Web UI (webui/dist-single/
// index.html, or an override supplied through NZVIDEOMNI_WEBUI_SINGLE_HTML) as a
// named RCDATA resource. webview_host.cpp looks this up at runtime with
// FindResourceW(module, L"NZVIDEOMNI_WEBUI_INDEX", RT_RCDATA); when present it is
// served from memory and the on-disk webui\ folder is not required.
//
// @NZVIDEOMNI_WEBUI_SINGLE_HTML_RC@ is a build-time absolute path with backslashes
// doubled for the RC string literal.
NZVIDEOMNI_WEBUI_INDEX RCDATA "@NZVIDEOMNI_WEBUI_SINGLE_HTML_RC@"
